Negative control for filter-i18n.test.ts.

Names the toggle group's positions from the leaf's own enum members instead of the
label JSON Forms' enum-option i18n resolved for them, so the bar draws the
schema's `true` / `false` where the catalogue's prose belongs. Any assertion that
reads a rendered member name — on the surface or as the accessible name — goes
red; the file's own fall-back case, which expects those raw member names when no
translator is supplied, stays green.

